								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><h5 style=\"text-align:center;\">Emergency Overnight Shelter</h5>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>The Salvation Army Of Augusta's Center of Hope:</strong></span>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Emergency Shelter (for single women and women with children): the line begins at 3:30 PM, and check-in begins at 4:00 PM until 7:00 PM. Dinner is at 5:00 PM. Check-out Is at 8:00 AM.</li>\n\t<li>Emergency Shelter (Men): the line starts at 3:30 PM. Check-in Is from 4:30 PM to 7:00 PM. Dinner at 4:30 PM. Check-out At 8:00 AM.</li>\n\t<li>Emergency Shelter (Family): the line begins at 3:30 PM, and check-in is at 4:00 PM. Dinner is at 5:00 PM.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\tFor more information, or to set up an appointment with a caseworker to find out more about our program, please call  <a href=\"tel:7068267933\">(706)-826-7933</a> or fill out the form below.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/augusta/contact\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Request Homeless Service</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://migration.salvationarmy.org/augusta/cold-weather-resources-in-augusta\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Cold Weather Resources</a></p></div>",
								"content": "<div style=\"color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><h5 style=\"text-align:center;\">Emergency Overnight Shelter</h5>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>The Salvation Army Of Augusta's Center of Hope:</strong></span>\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Emergency Shelter (for single women and women with children): the line begins at 3:30 PM, and check-in begins at 4:00 PM until 7:00 PM. Dinner is at 5:00 PM. Check-out Is at 8:00 AM.</li>\n\t<li>Emergency Shelter (Men): the line starts at 3:30 PM. Check-in Is from 4:30 PM to 7:00 PM. Dinner at 4:30 PM. Check-out At 8:00 AM.</li>\n\t<li>Emergency Shelter (Family): the line begins at 3:30 PM, and check-in is at 4:00 PM. Dinner is at 5:00 PM.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>\n\tFor more information, or to set up an appointment with a caseworker to find out more about our program, please call  <a href=\"tel:7068267933\">(706)-826-7933</a> or fill out the form below.\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/augusta/contact\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Request Homeless Service</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\n\t \n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://migration.salvationarmy.org/augusta/cold-weather-resources-in-augusta\" class=\"btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2\">Cold Weather Resources</a></p></div>",
								"description": "Text with HTML references.",
